From: Okty <okty111-ux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:10:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Display: ILI9341 2.8" TFT and XPT2046 touch

- display type 2: ILI9341 320x240 (same pages and driver as ST7789, other
  orientation/colour order); 2.8" modules ship with ILI9341 or ST7789V
- XPT2046 touch on the same SPI lines (own T_CS, T_DO, optional T_IRQ):
  tap = next page, hold 1 s = automatic switching on/off
- settings: new type, touch pins, sensible colour defaults per type

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
